<title>JORDAN: Jordan seeks 50,000 tonnes feed barley -trade.</title>
<headline>Jordan seeks 50,000 tonnes feed barley -trade.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan will tender on December 19 for 50,000 tonnes of U.S. feed barley or equivalent origin in one lot for shipment by the end of January, traders said.</p>
<p>They said offers must be received by Jordan's Ministry of Supply by December 19 with offers of U.S. origin under the GSM 102 programme.</p>
<p>-- Amman Bureau 9626+623776</p>
</text>
